            {"question":"The nurse's FIRST responsibility in maintaining a safe environment is to:","options":["Begin medication therapy","Assess the environment for hazards","Restrict all movement","Refer the patient for surgery"],"answer":"Assess the environment for hazards"},
            {"question":"A slippery bathroom floor represents which type of hazard?","options":["Biological","Physical","Chemical","Psychosocial"],"answer":"Physical"},
            {"question":"A caregiver who verbally insults an elderly client is creating:","options":["A thermal hazard","A psychosocial hazard","A biological hazard","A chemical hazard"],"answer":"A psychosocial hazard"},
            {"question":"Which nursing recommendation specifically targets slip prevention?","options":["Increase room temperature","Wear proper shoes","Increase medication dosage","Restrict fluid intake"],"answer":"Wear proper shoes"},
            {"question":"Which statement is MOST correct regarding environmental safety?","options":["It focuses only on preventing infections.","It involves creating surroundings free from dangers that may cause harm.","It applies only to workplaces.","It eliminates all health risks permanently."],"answer":"It involves creating surroundings free from dangers that may cause harm."},
            {"question":"An 80-year-old woman has several loose rugs in her hallway and recently slipped while walking. According to the lecture, the FIRST nursing recommendation is to:","options":["Remove all furniture","Place non-skid material under the rugs or secure them","Encourage walking barefoot","Keep the rugs wet for traction"],"answer":"Place non-skid material under the rugs or secure them"},
            {"question":"A nurse visits an elderly client's home and notices poor lighting near the stairs with no color markings at a change in floor height. Which intervention is MOST appropriate?","options":["Improve lighting and add bright color markings","Advise the client to avoid using the stairs permanently","Turn off lights during the day","Remove the staircase"],"answer":"Improve lighting and add bright color markings"},
